fix(ci): pin dorny/paths-filter to valid v3.0.4 SHA

The changes job added in af14c2ce pinned a non-existent commit SHA
(2cc35dfe...), so every CI run failed at the Detect changed surfaces step
and all dependent jobs were skipped. Pin the action to the v3.0.4 tag SHA
(0e4a8c6e...) which preserves the boolean outputs the workflow compares
against; v4 changed output semantics and would require rewriting the gates.